# Rebuilt inside the image, or irrelevant to it.
node_modules
**/node_modules
.next
**/.next
**/.content-collections
**/dist
coverage
**/coverage
test-results
playwright-report
.git
.goflag

# Secrets never enter the build context.
.env
.env.*

# Deliberately not `*.md`: the site's content is MDX under apps/website/content,
# and the changelog page reads packages/cli/CHANGELOG.md at build time. Both
# would disappear from the context and the build would fail — or worse, succeed
# with an empty changelog.
